# Android Remote Control / 云机远程控制 — Project System Rules

## Session Start

1. Read PROJECT.md and session-handoff.md at the start of every conversation. Check the Language setting in CLAUDE.md to determine output language.
2. Read logs bounded by the Log Compaction Threshold. Skip if log/ does not exist.

## End Session Protocol

When user says "end session" / "结束会话" / "收工":

1. Write log/session-YYYY-MM-DD-{slug}.md.
2. Compact logs if threshold is reached.
3. Update session-handoff.md.
4. Update PROJECT.md if structure or module status changed.
5. Update TODO.md.
6. Collect CLAUDE.md candidates into .claude/candidates.md.
7. Reorganize changed files incrementally using STRUCTURE.md.
7.5. Archive documents to docs/ and update DOCS.md.
8. Evaluate and write UPDATE_LOG.md if changes are significant.
9. Output summary in configured language.

## Project Boundary

Agno is only the Cloud Phone Operator Agent. It must not replace Relay, Android App, command queue, authentication, audit, MJPEG, ADB Bridge, or deterministic platform APIs.
